# What a release generates and packages. None of it is source, and the last
# rename put a 78 KB executable in a commit because this file still named the
# old one: a pattern here is the only thing standing between a build artifact
# and the history.
/README.TXT
/LICENSE.TXT
/DOS32A.TXT
/SKIDST*.ZIP
/skidset-*-win32.zip
/SHA256SUMS
